      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "NAVIGATOR (navigator.md)\n\nAcronym = phase order: N Narrow · A Acquire · V View · I Imprint · G Gym · A Act · T Thread · O Outline · R Recalibrate.\nPhases table: 1 Narrow→contract/stop/depth | 2 Acquire→sources+map | 3 View→structure not highlights | 4 Imprint→NEDF/CAST/SPEAR/numeric+Anki | 5 Gym→bottlenecks+error log | 6 Act→transfer artifact | 7 Thread→cross-domain graph | 8 Outline→cheat sheets | 9 Recalibrate→retro ONE variable.\nLearning contract: success criteria · constraints · stop rule · target depth · expected return.\nDOK: 1 recall terms | 2 explain/classify | 3 use under constraints | 4 transfer artifact — Act schedules DOK3–4.\nWhy forgetting: weak View · no retrieval · no bottleneck isolation · weak feedback · no spacing (onboarding-path) · depth mismatch.\nQuick start 6: Narrow contract → Acquire 3 sources → View map → Imprint+Gym batch → Act mission → Recalibrate.\nRule: NAVIGATOR sequences when; does NOT replace 5 gates or encoder choice.\nDefaults: input hrs · process % retrieval · output encodings/hr · outcome transfer · D1/D7/D30 checks · ROI.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NAVIGATOR (navigator.md)\n\nAcronym = phase order: N Narrow · A Acquire · V View · I Imprint · G Gym · A Act · T Thread · O Outline · R Recalibrate.\nPhases table: 1 Narrow→contract/stop/depth | 2 Acquire→sources+map | 3 View→structure not highlights | 4 Imprint→NEDF/CAST/SPEAR/numeric+Anki | 5 Gym→bottlenecks+error log | 6 Act→transfer artifact | 7 Thread→cross-domain graph | 8 Outline→cheat sheets | 9 Recalibrate→retro ONE variable.\nLearning contract: success criteria · constraints · stop rule · target depth · expected return.\nDOK: 1 recall terms | 2 explain/classify | 3 use under constraints | 4 transfer artifact — Act schedules DOK3–4.\nWhy forgetting: weak View · no retrieval · no bottleneck isolation · weak feedback · no spacing (onboarding-path) · depth mismatch.\nQuick start 6: Narrow contract → Acquire 3 sources → View map → Imprint+Gym batch → Act mission → Recalibrate.\nRule: NAVIGATOR sequences when; does NOT replace 5 gates or encoder choice.\nDefaults: input hrs · process % retrieval · output encodings/hr · outcome transfer · D1/D7/D30 checks · ROI.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
