      "text": "Design orientation (design-orientation.md)\n\nFour clusters: (1) Life & EQ — resilience, critical thinking, empathy scripts, decisions+Narrow+measurement. (2) Digital & future — literacy/safety SPEAR+NEDF, APIs CAST+Narrow, creativity Represent gate. (3) Practical everyday — finance NEDF+numeric, self-mgmt externalize+cues, household SPEAR+palace, safety SPEAR high-stakes. (4) Global citizenship — sustainability CAST+Falsify, culture timelines+graphs.\nSTEAM/STEMM table: Science NEDF+formulas+measure | Tech CAST+SPEAR+binary/hex | Eng Heuristic+domain patterns | Arts Represent+vivid | Math NEDF/CAST+formulas | Medicine SPEAR+never skip comprehension+verify externally.\nQuick map stuck→tool: Life vague→meta+Narrow | people dynamics→Comprehension+Represent+CAST | digital safe→SPEAR+NEDF fraud | deps→CAST | sequence→SPEAR+palace | money confuse→NEDF D/F | causes→CAST+falsify | scale→Minimize+graph.\nNavigator: Narrow names HUMAN outcome; Act = observable behavior not streak only.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design orientation (design-orientation.md)\n\nFour clusters: (1) Life & EQ — resilience, critical thinking, empathy scripts, decisions+Narrow+measurement. (2) Digital & future — literacy/safety SPEAR+NEDF, APIs CAST+Narrow, creativity Represent gate. (3) Practical everyday — finance NEDF+numeric, self-mgmt externalize+cues, household SPEAR+palace, safety SPEAR high-stakes. (4) Global citizenship — sustainability CAST+Falsify, culture timelines+graphs.\nSTEAM/STEMM table: Science NEDF+formulas+measure | Tech CAST+SPEAR+binary/hex | Eng Heuristic+domain patterns | Arts Represent+vivid | Math NEDF/CAST+formulas | Medicine SPEAR+never skip comprehension+verify externally.\nQuick map stuck→tool: Life vague→meta+Narrow | people dynamics→Comprehension+Represent+CAST | digital safe→SPEAR+NEDF fraud | deps→CAST | sequence→SPEAR+palace | money confuse→NEDF D/F | causes→CAST+falsify | scale→Minimize+graph.\nNavigator: Narrow names HUMAN outcome; Act = observable behavior not streak only.",
