      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Confusion Triage (confusion-triage.md)\n\nFirst move: one sentence \"I don't understand [X] because [Y].\"\nFive kinds → move: A Prerequisite gap → backfill atom only · two-levels-down if 3+ unknowns · trap: prerequisite spiral by continuing.\nB Tangled concepts → separation: name 2–5 ideas on separate lines · test each · weak link gets Comprehension alone.\nC Wrong mental model → find broken assumption · trace to contradiction.\nD Missing representation → add viz/compute from checklist.\nE Scale mismatch → zoom in/out to right abstraction.\nAnti-pattern: re-read whole vs triage early.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Confusion Triage (confusion-triage.md)\n\nFirst move: one sentence \"I don't understand [X] because [Y].\"\nFive kinds → move: A Prerequisite gap → backfill atom only · two-levels-down if 3+ unknowns · trap: prerequisite spiral by continuing.\nB Tangled concepts → separation: name 2–5 ideas on separate lines · test each · weak link gets Comprehension alone.\nC Wrong mental model → find broken assumption · trace to contradiction.\nD Missing representation → add viz/compute from checklist.\nE Scale mismatch → zoom in/out to right abstraction.\nAnti-pattern: re-read whole vs triage early.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
