      "text": "Heuristic Palace — Rooms 1–2 (heuristic-palace.md)\n\nNOT domain storage palaces → mind-palace.md for course graphs. This = permanent problem-solving walk ~90s core.\nPrinciples: fixed layout · ordered rooms · locus=heuristic · core+ wings · walk when stuck.\nR1 UNDERSTAND: 1.1 Mirror restate · 1.2 Glass case givens/unknowns/assumptions · 1.3 Scale hard vs soft · 1.4 Example bench concrete · 1.5 Goal clock done-state · 1.6 Ideality portrait TRIZ ideal final result.\nR2 REFRAME: 2.1 Inverter fail-first · 2.2 Analogy window same skeleton · 2.3 Base rate jar outside view · 2.4 Zoom lens scale · 2.5 Backward arrow from goal · 2.6 Steel mask opposite · 2.7 Time splitter TRIZ · 2.8 Space splitter · 2.9 Condition switch · 2.10 Russian dolls level split.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Heuristic Palace — Rooms 1–2 (heuristic-palace.md)\n\nNOT domain storage palaces → mind-palace.md for course graphs. This = permanent problem-solving walk ~90s core.\nPrinciples: fixed layout · ordered rooms · locus=heuristic · core+ wings · walk when stuck.\nR1 UNDERSTAND: 1.1 Mirror restate · 1.2 Glass case givens/unknowns/assumptions · 1.3 Scale hard vs soft · 1.4 Example bench concrete · 1.5 Goal clock done-state · 1.6 Ideality portrait TRIZ ideal final result.\nR2 REFRAME: 2.1 Inverter fail-first · 2.2 Analogy window same skeleton · 2.3 Base rate jar outside view · 2.4 Zoom lens scale · 2.5 Backward arrow from goal · 2.6 Steel mask opposite · 2.7 Time splitter TRIZ · 2.8 Space splitter · 2.9 Condition switch · 2.10 Russian dolls level split.",
