      "text": "Heuristic Palace — Rooms 3–4\n\nR3 CLASSIFY: 3.1 Specimen jars genus (search/opt/CSP/fixed-point/composition/decomp/classify/causal/pattern/equiv) · 3.2 Shape chart ∞↻⇄→⊥∩ · 3.3 Dimension dial 1D–∞D · 3.4 Conservation ledger invariants · 3.5 Dimensional stamp units/types.\nR4 PLAN (7): 4.1 Toolbox pattern match · 4.2 Drawbridge decompose · 4.3 Simpler world relax constraint · 4.4 Bridge invariants · 4.5 Fermi napkin OOM · 4.6 Renaming table change vars · 4.7 Contradiction room proof by ¬.\nWings attach R4: Debug D1–D8 bisect/min repro/assumption dump/state/reverse tape/env diff/duck trace/read-before-write.",
