      "text": "Heuristic Palace — R5–R6 + Wings P/X/S\n\nR5 EXECUTE: 5.1 Anvil smallest E2E first · 5.2 Checkpoint flags test each step · 5.3 Rubber duck aloud · 5.4 Stopwatch timebox→R2 if stuck · 5.5 Error log clipboard patterns.\nR6 REVIEW: 6.1 Journal what worked+why · 6.2 Graveyard failed attempts+why · 6.3 Generalizer class of problems · 6.4 Assumption audit · 6.5 Delta note next-time card.\nProof wing P1–P10: direct · contradiction · induction · construction · pigeonhole · genfn/bijection · extremal · probabilistic · infinite descent · WLOG symmetry.\nDesign X1–X10: separate concerns · illegal states unrepresentable · composition>inheritance · common vs rare case · minimize shared mutable · explicit>implicit · errors as data · observability · TRIZ matrix · TRIZ 20 principles.\nStrategy S1–S8: pre-mortem · reversibility · bottleneck · 2nd order · EV vs regret · asymmetric payoffs · cheap experiment · kill criteria.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Heuristic Palace — R5–R6 + Wings P/X/S\n\nR5 EXECUTE: 5.1 Anvil smallest E2E first · 5.2 Checkpoint flags test each step · 5.3 Rubber duck aloud · 5.4 Stopwatch timebox→R2 if stuck · 5.5 Error log clipboard patterns.\nR6 REVIEW: 6.1 Journal what worked+why · 6.2 Graveyard failed attempts+why · 6.3 Generalizer class of problems · 6.4 Assumption audit · 6.5 Delta note next-time card.\nProof wing P1–P10: direct · contradiction · induction · construction · pigeonhole · genfn/bijection · extremal · probabilistic · infinite descent · WLOG symmetry.\nDesign X1–X10: separate concerns · illegal states unrepresentable · composition>inheritance · common vs rare case · minimize shared mutable · explicit>implicit · errors as data · observability · TRIZ matrix · TRIZ 20 principles.\nStrategy S1–S8: pre-mortem · reversibility · bottleneck · 2nd order · EV vs regret · asymmetric payoffs · cheap experiment · kill criteria.",
