      "text": "Domain patterns · TRIZ · Metacognition\n\nDomain patterns (domain-patterns.md): ~30/domain — Name · Signature · Mechanism · Canonical use · Variants · Failure mode · Encoding. Domains: algorithms proofs debug design biases. After HP R3 classify → match library.\nTRIZ (triz.md condensed): Ideality · 4 Separations time/space/condition/level · 20 Inventive Principles · 12×12 Contradiction Matrix. Integrated HP: Ideality R1.6 · Separations R2.7–2.10 · Matrix+principles Design wing X9–X10.\nMetacognitive (metacognitive-checklist.md): checkpoints Before · Mid ~25min · End · Next day. Before: goal/why/test/budget/MVO/anti-scope. Mid 4 Qs: learning vs scanning · confabulating · above level · performing vs having. File also lists 9 self-deception patterns + weekly meta-review.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Domain patterns · TRIZ · Metacognition\n\nDomain patterns (domain-patterns.md): ~30/domain — Name · Signature · Mechanism · Canonical use · Variants · Failure mode · Encoding. Domains: algorithms proofs debug design biases. After HP R3 classify → match library.\nTRIZ (triz.md condensed): Ideality · 4 Separations time/space/condition/level · 20 Inventive Principles · 12×12 Contradiction Matrix. Integrated HP: Ideality R1.6 · Separations R2.7–2.10 · Matrix+principles Design wing X9–X10.\nMetacognitive (metacognitive-checklist.md): checkpoints Before · Mid ~25min · End · Next day. Before: goal/why/test/budget/MVO/anti-scope. Mid 4 Qs: learning vs scanning · confabulating · above level · performing vs having. File also lists 9 self-deception patterns + weekly meta-review.",
