      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "NEDF · SPEAR · Formulas\n\nNEDF (concept-encoding.md): Name-hook · Essence · Distinguisher · Failure — all four load-bearing; Failure from Gate4 Essence from Gate2. Name: Major or pun/rhyme. Essence: verb-like core mechanism. Distinguisher: vs neighbor concept. Failure: classic collapse.\nSPEAR (procedure-encoding.md): Scene (moving gestalt) · Preconditions (gate) · Execution (story chain not flat list; branching) · Alternatives (if/else) · Repair (when slip). Fixes: recite-without-execute · lost branching · step inflation · no recovery. Execution styles: causal chain ≤7 steps · spatial path 8–20 · recursive scene.\nFormulas (formulas.md): atom library Greek+operators as images · structural zones up/down/left/right/center · composition sequential/structural/hybrid.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NEDF · SPEAR · Formulas\n\nNEDF (concept-encoding.md): Name-hook · Essence · Distinguisher · Failure — all four load-bearing; Failure from Gate4 Essence from Gate2. Name: Major or pun/rhyme. Essence: verb-like core mechanism. Distinguisher: vs neighbor concept. Failure: classic collapse.\nSPEAR (procedure-encoding.md): Scene (moving gestalt) · Preconditions (gate) · Execution (story chain not flat list; branching) · Alternatives (if/else) · Repair (when slip). Fixes: recite-without-execute · lost branching · step inflation · no recovery. Execution styles: causal chain ≤7 steps · spatial path 8–20 · recursive scene.\nFormulas (formulas.md): atom library Greek+operators as images · structural zones up/down/left/right/center · composition sequential/structural/hybrid.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
