      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "CAST + Georgian (cast-system.md · georgian-system.md)\n\nGraph = nodes (Georgian) + edges (CAST 8 bits → 4 slots). Palace proximity = connectivity optional.\nGeorgian node: Animal identity · Person disambig · Adjective state · Environment cluster — quadruple same-letter sound; table 33 letters in georgian-system.md. Procedure: pick letter→env cluster (palace may override)→adj state→place animal in env.\nCAST name Character · Action · Stream · Time — bits AB CD EF GH. Character: 00 Giant→ hub · 01 Mermaid↔ peer · 10 Mage→ service · 11 Dragon← reactor. Action: 00 crush strong · 01 flow medium · 10 spread weak · 11 explode critical. Stream: 00 rock data · 01 water energy · 10 cloud info · 11 stone events. Time: 00 red cave permanent · 01 blue ocean active · 10 green sky conditional · 11 purple storm temporal.\nStudio: src/data/castLexicon.js sync with spec. Beginner: cast-beginner-bilingual.md EN+ქართ+RU glosses same slots. 8-bit binary row aligns CAST slots (binary-hex.md).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CAST + Georgian (cast-system.md · georgian-system.md)\n\nGraph = nodes (Georgian) + edges (CAST 8 bits → 4 slots). Palace proximity = connectivity optional.\nGeorgian node: Animal identity · Person disambig · Adjective state · Environment cluster — quadruple same-letter sound; table 33 letters in georgian-system.md. Procedure: pick letter→env cluster (palace may override)→adj state→place animal in env.\nCAST name Character · Action · Stream · Time — bits AB CD EF GH. Character: 00 Giant→ hub · 01 Mermaid↔ peer · 10 Mage→ service · 11 Dragon← reactor. Action: 00 crush strong · 01 flow medium · 10 spread weak · 11 explode critical. Stream: 00 rock data · 01 water energy · 10 cloud info · 11 stone events. Time: 00 red cave permanent · 01 blue ocean active · 10 green sky conditional · 11 purple storm temporal.\nStudio: src/data/castLexicon.js sync with spec. Beginner: cast-beginner-bilingual.md EN+ქართ+RU glosses same slots. 8-bit binary row aligns CAST slots (binary-hex.md).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
