      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Numeric stack (major · pao · sem3 · peg · hex/binary)\n\nMajor: S/Z=0 D/T=1 N=2 M=3 R=4 L=5 J/SH/CH=6 K/G=7 F/V=8 B/P=9 → 00–99 words (full table major-system.md).\nPAO: 10×10×10 Person+Action+Object phonetically Major-aligned; phone 9-digit = PAO×3.\nSEM3: 4-digit CIXX — CI category×10+item sensory prefix + Major XX suffix. Categories 0 Vision…9 Solar (full sem3-full.md).\nPeg Matrix: audio tens 0 Hero…9 Wine × visual units 0 Donut…9 Balloon → 37 Tree+Axe etc.\nHex: element×state 4×4 scenes 0–F. Binary: 4-bit=hex nibble; 8-bit two nibbles / four slots (CAST isomorphism).\nDecision lengths (SKILL): 2 Major | 3 PAO | 4 SEM3+Major | 6 default PAO×2 or SEM3+Major+Peg if middle sensory | 8 SEM3+Major×2 | 9 phone PAO×3 | 10 SEM3+Major×2+Peg | 12 Peg+SEM3+Major×2 or ×3 | lists Peg | hex Hex | binary 4/8-bit.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Numeric stack (major · pao · sem3 · peg · hex/binary)\n\nMajor: S/Z=0 D/T=1 N=2 M=3 R=4 L=5 J/SH/CH=6 K/G=7 F/V=8 B/P=9 → 00–99 words (full table major-system.md).\nPAO: 10×10×10 Person+Action+Object phonetically Major-aligned; phone 9-digit = PAO×3.\nSEM3: 4-digit CIXX — CI category×10+item sensory prefix + Major XX suffix. Categories 0 Vision…9 Solar (full sem3-full.md).\nPeg Matrix: audio tens 0 Hero…9 Wine × visual units 0 Donut…9 Balloon → 37 Tree+Axe etc.\nHex: element×state 4×4 scenes 0–F. Binary: 4-bit=hex nibble; 8-bit two nibbles / four slots (CAST isomorphism).\nDecision lengths (SKILL): 2 Major | 3 PAO | 4 SEM3+Major | 6 default PAO×2 or SEM3+Major+Peg if middle sensory | 8 SEM3+Major×2 | 9 phone PAO×3 | 10 SEM3+Major×2+Peg | 12 Peg+SEM3+Major×2 or ×3 | lists Peg | hex Hex | binary 4/8-bit.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
