      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Onboarding · satellites · examples index\n\nOnboarding (onboarding-path.md): Invariants — one scheduler · one session log · rewrite>grind · Locate+Represent before CAST greenfield · contract from Narrow for bounded units · design-orientation for life decks.\nLevel A minimal weeks1–2: SKILL skim · Major OR 00–19 bootstrap · one palace 8–12 loci fixed order · Anki ≤10 new/day · one template. Week2 review-only walks · 3× lapse→one repair · stop new subsystems. Exit 7d: reviews under ceiling · Major vs palace verbalized · no card >8 lapses without ticket.\nLevel B mid weeks3–8: 5 NEDF real · SEM3+Major OR PAO pick one month · 20 new/day only if weekly flat · binary 16 hex cards · 3 CAST edges · optional cast-beginner-bilingual · second palace route · read retrieval 2–3 + weekly full walk · skim collisions #collision-risk. Exit: living CAST mini-graph · chunk automatic · measurement once weakest dim.\nLevel C maximal: Georgian+CAST scale · SPEAR · domain hooks · belts — +1 subsystem OR +1 domain per 4wk block never both. Block themes: graph · procedure · measurement · collision audit · navigator sprint.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Onboarding · satellites · examples index\n\nOnboarding (onboarding-path.md): Invariants — one scheduler · one session log · rewrite>grind · Locate+Represent before CAST greenfield · contract from Narrow for bounded units · design-orientation for life decks.\nLevel A minimal weeks1–2: SKILL skim · Major OR 00–19 bootstrap · one palace 8–12 loci fixed order · Anki ≤10 new/day · one template. Week2 review-only walks · 3× lapse→one repair · stop new subsystems. Exit 7d: reviews under ceiling · Major vs palace verbalized · no card >8 lapses without ticket.\nLevel B mid weeks3–8: 5 NEDF real · SEM3+Major OR PAO pick one month · 20 new/day only if weekly flat · binary 16 hex cards · 3 CAST edges · optional cast-beginner-bilingual · second palace route · read retrieval 2–3 + weekly full walk · skim collisions #collision-risk. Exit: living CAST mini-graph · chunk automatic · measurement once weakest dim.\nLevel C maximal: Georgian+CAST scale · SPEAR · domain hooks · belts — +1 subsystem OR +1 domain per 4wk block never both. Block themes: graph · procedure · measurement · collision audit · navigator sprint.",
