      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Mind Palace vs Heuristic (mind-palace.md)\n\nDomain palaces: spatial container for payloads; does NOT replace NEDF/CAST/SPEAR/Major. Palace=geography+order+proximity semantics; locus=one stop; bind stable real/imagined/hybrid; freeze canonical walk order; context prefix neighborhood+direction.\nHeuristic Palace stays SEPARATE permanent file — never mix course loci into heuristic routes by accident.\nEmbedding: CAST graphs walkable in palace; nesting diagrams in mind-palace.md.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mind Palace vs Heuristic (mind-palace.md)\n\nDomain palaces: spatial container for payloads; does NOT replace NEDF/CAST/SPEAR/Major. Palace=geography+order+proximity semantics; locus=one stop; bind stable real/imagined/hybrid; freeze canonical walk order; context prefix neighborhood+direction.\nHeuristic Palace stays SEPARATE permanent file — never mix course loci into heuristic routes by accident.\nEmbedding: CAST graphs walkable in palace; nesting diagrams in mind-palace.md.",
