      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "ZLP + FRS (zero-loss-forced-recall.md)\n\nZLP matter: failure chain Action→no attention→no encoding→lost. Principle: No image=no memory. A1 fixed anchor one coordinate keys/bag. A2 drop marker whisper line + exaggerated micro-scene at anchor. A3 identity amplification table keys/backpack/wallet caricatures permanent. A4 retrieval when missing: replay last 3 scenes blank=no encoding backtrack path not free-assoc repair louder marker.\nFRS time: stored→no trigger→no access→missed. Principle: force memory into awareness. B1 Today Core ≤5 loci ONLY hard deadlines/critical tasks dashboard exclusive. B2 triple triggers: feet floor wake / hand door leave / head pillow sleep →10s pass; 2–3 alarms CHECK SYSTEM; overwhelm→\"Check palace.\" B3 ten-second rule name payloads order empty=promote/demote. B4 reset stop+breath what matters now open Today Core smallest next step.\nCAST lens: multitasking → skipped encoding ZLP OR skipped triggers FRS. Daily flow table: object→ZLP | wake/leave/sleep both | alarm FRS | overwhelm check palace.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ZLP + FRS (zero-loss-forced-recall.md)\n\nZLP matter: failure chain Action→no attention→no encoding→lost. Principle: No image=no memory. A1 fixed anchor one coordinate keys/bag. A2 drop marker whisper line + exaggerated micro-scene at anchor. A3 identity amplification table keys/backpack/wallet caricatures permanent. A4 retrieval when missing: replay last 3 scenes blank=no encoding backtrack path not free-assoc repair louder marker.\nFRS time: stored→no trigger→no access→missed. Principle: force memory into awareness. B1 Today Core ≤5 loci ONLY hard deadlines/critical tasks dashboard exclusive. B2 triple triggers: feet floor wake / hand door leave / head pillow sleep →10s pass; 2–3 alarms CHECK SYSTEM; overwhelm→\"Check palace.\" B3 ten-second rule name payloads order empty=promote/demote. B4 reset stop+breath what matters now open Today Core smallest next step.\nCAST lens: multitasking → skipped encoding ZLP OR skipped triggers FRS. Daily flow table: object→ZLP | wake/leave/sleep both | alarm FRS | overwhelm check palace.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
