      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Retrieval Protocol (retrieval-protocol.md)\n\nThree components: (1) Encoding→Anki templates per system: Major both dirs · PAO 3 cards per entry · SEM3+decomposition on back · Georgian letter/name/month→4-slot+person · Hex/byte cards · NEDF+4 clozes+symptom→concept · CAST src→tgt+scene→bits · Formula atom zones+reverse · Heuristic locus ID+symptom→locus. (2) Palace-walk cadence: Heuristic DAILY ~60s full | active domain every 2–3d full | background WEEKLY 3 random loci + log weak links. (3) Weak-link repair: simplify split prerequisite re-encode per doc.\nTagging #major #sem3 #cast #nedf #domain #palace-name filters drills.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Retrieval Protocol (retrieval-protocol.md)\n\nThree components: (1) Encoding→Anki templates per system: Major both dirs · PAO 3 cards per entry · SEM3+decomposition on back · Georgian letter/name/month→4-slot+person · Hex/byte cards · NEDF+4 clozes+symptom→concept · CAST src→tgt+scene→bits · Formula atom zones+reverse · Heuristic locus ID+symptom→locus. (2) Palace-walk cadence: Heuristic DAILY ~60s full | active domain every 2–3d full | background WEEKLY 3 random loci + log weak links. (3) Weak-link repair: simplify split prerequisite re-encode per doc.\nTagging #major #sem3 #cast #nedf #domain #palace-name filters drills.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
