      "text": "Collisions (collisions.md)\n\nPrinciple: same image OK if meanings do not compete same context; strengthen system-markers if ambiguous.\nSection A fixed swaps: Net→Needle PAO-O2 · Map→Mask PAO-O3 · Bomb→Bell PAO-O9 · Ball→Donut Peg-V0 — note Mask/Bell cross-formula disambig by scene role B6.\nB1 SEM3 animals vs Georgian: zebra deer elephant giraffe flamingo dinosaur bat cat — rule numeric SEM3 vs graph Georgian contexts markers sensory+Major vs quad-alliteration.\nB2 elemental words rock lightning… across SEM3 hex CAST — rule role in scene picks system.\nOnly same-role collisions require swaps (rest of file: B3–B6 patterns read collisions.md).",
