      "text": "Measurement (measurement-framework.md)\n\nSix dimensions independent: 1 Speed EPH ART PWT RUS · 2 Accuracy CFT% regen · 3 Depth complexity Webb ties NAVIGATOR DOK · 4 Durability mature retention D30/D90 · 5 Application 48h apply rate · 6 Process protocol adherence self-deception catches. Belts each dim White→Yellow→Orange→Green→Blue→Purple→Brown→Black numeric thresholds; advance = sustain 14d. LPQ = geometric mean of 6 normalized ×125 range ~125–1000 lagging dims hurt.\nDaily 30s log: Date · encodings count · palace walks · applied · stuck/triaged · self-deception caught · energy 1–5. Weekly Anki pull: reviews CFT% median RT mature count retention. Quarterly audits.",
