      "originalText": "SKILL: master rules · principles · file index\n\nMaster WHEN table excerpts: whole unit NAVIGATOR · difficult concept 5 gates · stuck understand Confusion · stuck solve Heuristic · contradiction TRIZ · ideality redefine · pattern Domain after R3 · audit Meta · number numeric table · thing NEDF · relationship CAST · network Georgian+CAST · procedure SPEAR · formula Formula · date Georgian+Major+optional weekday colors · full calendar line calendar-time-memorization.md · Bible order bible-memorization.md · lecture lecture-listening-notes.md · 33-item list Georgian sequence · consolidate Mind palace · consolidate Retrieval · lost object ZLP · missed deadline FRS · improve Measurement.\nDecision Qs: load in thing vs connections? datatype? length? permanence palace vs peg? context domain palace?\nKey principles 1–16 SKILL: comprehension before encode · images before words · multi-sensory · emotion · Major anchor · NEDF vs CAST · classify before plan · regeneration test · meta above · palace=context not content · active recall Anki · failure in scenes · collisions managed · measure trajectory · TRIZ separate not compromise · stop rule Narrow · encoding-examples.md worked numeric.",
