      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Collisions B3–D (collisions.md continued)\n\nB3 SEM3 colors vs CAST Time: red 80 vs 00 · blue 84 vs 01 · green 83 vs 10 — SEM3=color ON object · CAST=color AS environment (cave/ocean/sky). Red object inside CAST: non-red object glowing red.\nB4 Major↔Georgian shared words fan/chair/tree/forest/bread/gate — Major in number decomposition · Georgian env only inside quad-alliteration sentence.\nB5 Heuristic loci duck/case/base… — no conflict: only when walking heuristic palace deliberately.\nB6 Greek Ψψ Ωω Σ∑ — upper=structural aggregate lower=variable; mnemonic mirrors math.\nB7 Σ=∑ same image intentional · Ψ vs ∇ orientation upright vs downward.\nB8 giant/dragon/mage/mermaid: CAST humanoid vs formula Δ geometric mountain.\nSection C algorithm: (1) what encoding kind (2) which system (3) second layer? (4) clash? (5) apply rule/marker.\nPrinciples: most OK context · same-role NOT OK swap · SEM3/Georgian animals by design differentiate · system-markers · under-specified scene fix marker not rename.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Collisions B3–D (collisions.md continued)\n\nB3 SEM3 colors vs CAST Time: red 80 vs 00 · blue 84 vs 01 · green 83 vs 10 — SEM3=color ON object · CAST=color AS environment (cave/ocean/sky). Red object inside CAST: non-red object glowing red.\nB4 Major↔Georgian shared words fan/chair/tree/forest/bread/gate — Major in number decomposition · Georgian env only inside quad-alliteration sentence.\nB5 Heuristic loci duck/case/base… — no conflict: only when walking heuristic palace deliberately.\nB6 Greek Ψψ Ωω Σ∑ — upper=structural aggregate lower=variable; mnemonic mirrors math.\nB7 Σ=∑ same image intentional · Ψ vs ∇ orientation upright vs downward.\nB8 giant/dragon/mage/mermaid: CAST humanoid vs formula Δ geometric mountain.\nSection C algorithm: (1) what encoding kind (2) which system (3) second layer? (4) clash? (5) apply rule/marker.\nPrinciples: most OK context · same-role NOT OK swap · SEM3/Georgian animals by design differentiate · system-markers · under-specified scene fix marker not rename.",
