      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Retrieval — walks · repair · encode policy\n\nWalk procedure: enter palace · canonical order never randomize · per locus <2s strong · 2–5s acceptable reinforce · >5s weak flag · fail severe · log weak IDs finish walk first · queue repairs after.\nWhy timed: Anki no time pressure; real solve needs speed.\nMetrics log: date · duration · weak flags · repair count — trend down; if duration up or flags plateau split palace.\nWeak-link tree: NO blank→re-encode/new locus | YES slow: see scene not payload→weak link add SEM3 | dim scene→vivify | loci bleed→relocate | confuse sibling→NEDF Distinguisher explicit.\nRepair cost order: 1 Vivify 1min REMAPS Rotate/Exaggerate/Modify/Associate/Play/Senses · 2 Re-sensory SEM3 2min · 3 Relocate 5min · 4 Re-encode 10min · 5 Split palace 30m+. Checksum: one continuous interacting picture fails loud.\nEncode when: personal failure mode · looked up 2+ times · load-bearing · long-term value. Don't: once-only · trivial derive · no penalty forgetting.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Retrieval — walks · repair · encode policy\n\nWalk procedure: enter palace · canonical order never randomize · per locus <2s strong · 2–5s acceptable reinforce · >5s weak flag · fail severe · log weak IDs finish walk first · queue repairs after.\nWhy timed: Anki no time pressure; real solve needs speed.\nMetrics log: date · duration · weak flags · repair count — trend down; if duration up or flags plateau split palace.\nWeak-link tree: NO blank→re-encode/new locus | YES slow: see scene not payload→weak link add SEM3 | dim scene→vivify | loci bleed→relocate | confuse sibling→NEDF Distinguisher explicit.\nRepair cost order: 1 Vivify 1min REMAPS Rotate/Exaggerate/Modify/Associate/Play/Senses · 2 Re-sensory SEM3 2min · 3 Relocate 5min · 4 Re-encode 10min · 5 Split palace 30m+. Checksum: one continuous interacting picture fails loud.\nEncode when: personal failure mode · looked up 2+ times · load-bearing · long-term value. Don't: once-only · trivial derive · no penalty forgetting.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
