      "text": "Memorization helpers + deck authoring (SKILL)\n\nmemorization-helpers.md: for every theSystem spec + book workflows — NEDF the protocol · SPEAR how to run it · Comprehension mapping · ~15min first session per doc.\nDesigning new system steps: (1) datatype numbers/words/symbols/concepts/relations/procedures + natural structure pairs/triples/sequences/grid/graph (2) natural chunk size 2 Major/3 PAO/4 SEM3 or NEDF/grid cross-matrix/graph Georgian+CAST (3) imagery theme vivid distinct emotional (4) align consonants Major double-encode (5) scene template fixed output unique per combo test eyes closed (6) JS data file pattern DATA object + META array + IMAGES object zero-padded keys export {DECK_DATA,DECK_META,DECK_IMAGES}.",
