      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "SPEAR execution styles + CAST studio note\n\nSPEAR Style A causal chain ≤7 steps — step N output feeds N+1; Major/SEM3 for numbered steps. Style B spatial path 8–20 steps — sub-palace walk ordering; never 20+ in one causal chain breaks. Style C recursive — base case + recursive step two scenes one room e.g. merge sort.\nCAST lexicon: app src/data/castLexicon.js must match cast-system.md rows for playground+tests.\nGeorgian optional: month+day date encoding; weekday optional 7 spectrum ROYGBIV object banks; day 1–31 Georgian rows — georgian-system.md Optional calendar pegs.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SPEAR execution styles + CAST studio note\n\nSPEAR Style A causal chain ≤7 steps — step N output feeds N+1; Major/SEM3 for numbered steps. Style B spatial path 8–20 steps — sub-palace walk ordering; never 20+ in one causal chain breaks. Style C recursive — base case + recursive step two scenes one room e.g. merge sort.\nCAST lexicon: app src/data/castLexicon.js must match cast-system.md rows for playground+tests.\nGeorgian optional: month+day date encoding; weekday optional 7 spectrum ROYGBIV object banks; day 1–31 Georgian rows — georgian-system.md Optional calendar pegs.",
