      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Comprehension Gate details + triage moves (compact)\n\nGate2 checklist names: verbal plain · symbolic formal · geometric diagram · computational steps · adversarial nearly-breaks · extreme limits 0∞trivial boundary — min 3 of 6 ideally 4+.\nConfusion moves named: A backfill exact atom return same sentence · B separate ideas test each · C find wrong assumption · D add representation type · E zoom change abstraction level.\nHeuristic usage: walk core in order when stuck any domain; enter wings from R4 when generic tools fail; full core ~90s target; TRIZ after R1 contradiction or Design wing.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Comprehension Gate details + triage moves (compact)\n\nGate2 checklist names: verbal plain · symbolic formal · geometric diagram · computational steps · adversarial nearly-breaks · extreme limits 0∞trivial boundary — min 3 of 6 ideally 4+.\nConfusion moves named: A backfill exact atom return same sentence · B separate ideas test each · C find wrong assumption · D add representation type · E zoom change abstraction level.\nHeuristic usage: walk core in order when stuck any domain; enter wings from R4 when generic tools fail; full core ~90s target; TRIZ after R1 contradiction or Design wing.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
