      "text": "NAVIGATOR + Measurement cross-links\n\nNAVIGATOR non-linear: Recalibrate feeds any earlier phase. Memory stack owns Imprint→Retrieve; NAVIGATOR adds scope sources intake missions weave compress evolve.\nMeasurement reads onboarding session log; Dimension 3 Depth ties Webb DOK; belt tests monthly quarterly audits in measurement-framework.md full thresholds per dimension (Speed belts table White Black with EPH ART PWT RUS columns excerpt in doc).\nNavigator process failures list: weak View · no retrieval · no bottleneck isolation · weak feedback no error log · no spacing cramming · depth mismatch recognition vs strategic.",
